{"text": "At noon the Student opened his window and saw the red rose. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> What a wonderful piece of luck, he cried, Here is a red rose. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He picked the rose, put on his hat, and ran to the Professors house. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Professors daughter was sitting in the doorway, winding blue silk on a reel. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> You said that you would dance with me if I brought you a red rose, cried the Student. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But the girl frowned and said that the rose would not go with her dress. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Besides, the Chamberlains nephew has sent me some real jewels, she said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Everybody knows that jewels cost far more than flowers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Student became angry and threw the rose into the street, where a cart wheel went over it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> What a silly thing Love is, he said as he walked away. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is not half as useful as Logic, because it does not prove anything. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So he went back to his room, took out a big dusty book, and began to read.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", "t", " ", "n", "o", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "S", "t", "u", "d", "e", "n", "t", " ", "o", "p", "e", "n", "e", "d", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "w", "i", "n", "d", "o", "w", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "s", "a", "w", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "r", "e", "d", " ", "r", "o", "s", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "W", "h", "a", "t", " ", "a", " ", "w", "o", "n", "d", "e", "r", "f", "u", "l", " ", "p", "i", "e", "c", "e", " ", "o", "f", " ", "l", "u", "c", "k", ",", " ", "h", "e", " ", "c", "r", "i", "e", "d", ",", " ", "H", "e", "r", "e", " ", "i", "s", " ", "a", " ", "r", "e", "d", " ", "r", "o", "s", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "